  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, the huay may change the form of a creature with a touch. By taking 3 points of essence burn, they may affect a willing creature as with the polymorph spell.</p>\n<p>At 14th level, they may use this ability on unwilling creatures, as per baleful polymorph.</p>\n<p>At 16th level, they may use it on willing creatures as greater polymorph.</p>\n<p>Finally, at 18th level, they may use it as polymorph any object.</p>\n<p>The DC to resist this ability is equal to 10 + 1/2 huay level + Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
